WARNING NOTICE:
this document describes parts of LINLIB/VISI used 
as part of vash - Visual Assistant shell.

Only short library documentation files (mini-help) are included in this release:
 doc/*

The compilation procedure is performed as part of an assembly of vash
and shares common config ../BLD.cfg which controlled by ../Makefile.

Directories and files of LINLIB/VISI project:

  READ_ME   - this text
  doc/       - documentation
  doc/hlp/       mini-help pages

  These directories have to be installed to /usr or /usr/local,
  but used internally for assembly vash only:

  lib/      - runtime librries
  bin/      - framework utilities
  include/  - header files

  programs to be linked with LIBLIB:

  ../vash    - assistant shell itself
  ../vhset   - video hardware setup on user taste
  ../vtest   - testing of LINLIB

  src/       - sources of runtime libraries

  visi/      - user interaction preprocessors
